{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"6dd13314cf7ca7ae","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":720,"width":920,"height":300,"color":"5","label":"System 2 (Long-term utility estimator)"},
		{"id":"994f5ef6103d6ebf","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":400,"width":920,"height":260,"color":"5","label":"System 1 (Impulsive recommender)"},
		{"id":"fb289fc75436ae80","type":"group","x":-2240,"y":-300,"width":560,"height":340,"color":"5","label":"Shared State Encoder"},
		{"id":"b7fa2396fa7923e5","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":140,"width":920,"height":200,"color":"1","label":"Fatigue and Burden model"},
		{"id":"d0de99c7b3dd60b1","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":1080,"width":920,"height":190,"color":"1","label":"Gating mechanism (controller)"},
		{"id":"49f3e265b48c105f","type":"group","x":-1960,"y":-1160,"width":360,"height":380,"color":"6","label":"User Interaction Input"},
		{"id":"cc28064355ab6a41","type":"text","text":"**Transformer-based sequential model**\n\n(trained using cross-entropy loss to optimize for next click probability)","x":-1440,"y":420,"width":220,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"072812e698a1212b","type":"text","text":"At every time step, t:\n- UserID\n- ItemID\n- Timestamp\n- Dwell Time\n- Category\n- SessionID","x":-1940,"y":-1140,"width":318,"height":259},
		{"id":"ea8ba7e747945caf","type":"text","text":"$x_t​=(u, i_t​, t_t, dwell_t​, category_t​)$","x":-1940,"y":-860,"width":318,"height":60},
		{"id":"0b356aea2e68cee3","type":"text","text":"User behavioral signals\n- Entropy\n- Repetition\n- Session length","x":-1720,"y":-688,"width":240,"height":143,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c3e8f2ea85e7e905","type":"text","text":"Sequence of previous interactions - x_1:t-1","x":-2080,"y":-688,"width":240,"height":143,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0c932436086794d4","type":"text","text":"## Problem Statement\nModern recommender systems optimize for short-term engagement using correlation-based ranking models, ignoring **cognitive fatigue, long-term satisfaction, and human wellbeing**. This leads to overconsumption, boredom, and eventual churn. We propose a dual-system recommender that models user fatigue and dynamically balances short-term engagement with long-term utility to optimize sustained user value.","x":-2100,"y":-1480,"width":800,"height":240},
		{"id":"7e4e2c624e0315ef","type":"text","text":"## **Problem Statement:**\n\nDue to the rise in the ethical aspects of the recsys, a lot of work has been completed. Develop a symbolic reasoning layer in system 2 to verify if an empathetic response is genuinely useful\n\nusing LLMs to model several personas and letting them act as agents in a simulated environment to test and enhance our recsys algorithms -- NOO\ncreate an algorithm to model fatigue and burden\n\ncourse sequence recommender: recommending items based on their use rather than just based on the recent views\n\ntext is a high dimensional, sparse and inefficient medium for learning models, we can develop a system which can generate a continuous concept vector which can be used to query the dense item index\n\nnew item handling in system 2\n\ncomplexity risk of a request based selection of system1 vs system 2-based recommendations\n\n","x":-50,"y":-1340,"width":958,"height":480},
		{"id":"72ecce2106e14a2a","type":"text","text":"# **Dual-System Human-Centric Recommender with Fatigue-Aware Long-Term Optimization (DS-HCRS)**\n","x":-2220,"y":-1680,"width":920,"height":80},
		{"id":"70dbb4bccf9af7b9","type":"text","text":"Candidate scores for items - $P_1(i|s_t)$","x":-1200,"y":443,"width":260,"height":174,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"fdd1a37f666484ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Objective Function\n\nA loss derived from all three blocks:\n- Fatigue\n- System 1\n- System 2\n\n$L=L_{S1}​+λ_1​L_{S2}​+λ_2​L_{fatigue}​$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":420,
			"width":340,
			"height":340,
			"color":"#ffffff"
		},
		{"id":"63419b7dc898bbe1","type":"text","text":"Selected top-k candidates - $C_t = TopK(P_1)$","x":-920,"y":500,"width":260,"height":60},
		{"id":"a00108dd287cf667","type":"text","text":"Fatigue score, $f_t$","x":-1080,"y":160,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cf10e65aaa886a7c","type":"text","text":"Churn probability, p_churn","x":-1080,"y":260,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6e9a00dcbc427bb1","type":"text","text":"### Fatigue Model\n$F_t = model(F_t-1, s_t)$","x":-1440,"y":180,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0699d82cadb7803c","type":"text","text":"User latent embedding","x":-2220,"y":-40,"width":240,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"13b42f0e9fed996a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Feedback ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2380,
			"y":500,
			"width":200,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{"id":"cfaf9c4c6afe8bc1","type":"text","text":"**State**\n$S_t = f(s_t, f_s)$","x":-1440,"y":740,"width":320,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"23a5d75ba6460943","type":"text","text":"Choose an item from candidate set, $C_t$","x":-1440,"y":821,"width":320,"height":78,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"9e2451715ccd1554","type":"text","text":"Reward, $R_t = a.Click_t + b.Retention_{t+N} - c.f_t$","x":-1440,"y":920,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c17fc38e5ca4abc9","type":"text","text":"RL Algorithm","x":-1017,"y":821,"width":155,"height":78,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"19ea6a4ce2666070","type":"text","text":"Re-ranked scores, $P_2(i|S_t)$","x":-820,"y":821,"width":240,"height":78,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"105fb6a80983a9d9","type":"text","text":"Contextual session state","x":-1940,"y":-40,"width":240,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"18df5323c26ae2ab","type":"text","text":"$s_t = Encoder(x_{1:t-1})$","x":-2100,"y":-180,"width":280,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a49a9c99990012a0","type":"text","text":"Transformer-based Model","x":-2100,"y":-280,"width":280,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"42ebed38ffca687d","type":"text","text":"$g_t = \\sigma(MLP(s_t, f_t))$","x":-1410,"y":1140,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"3738964b22ab405b","type":"text","text":"$Score(i) = g_t.P_2(i) + (1-g_t).P_1(i)$","x":-1060,"y":1140,"width":308,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"6260d80d7925f41c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Output \n(System 1 recommendations or System 2 recommendations - Top1 or TopK)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1300,
			"y":1320,
			"width":600,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"ea9700cbb05ad78d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"User Interactions recorded:\n- Click/Skip\n- Dwell time\n- Continue session\n- Churn ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1180,
			"y":1460,
			"width":360,
			"height":180,
			"color":"2"
		}
	],
